{"meta":{"id":"json-response","category":"it/syntax/java/servlet","title":"JSON 응답 (HashMap → JSON) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"HashMap → JSONObject / JSONArray → 문자열로 ajax 에 응답 (json-simple)","tags":["java","f-network","json"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">JSON 응답 (HashMap → JSON) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> HashMap → JSONObject / JSONArray → 문자열로 ajax 에 응답 (json-simple)</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">VO 하나 → JSON 객체 (json-simple)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">HashMap&lt;String, String&gt; map = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();\r\nmap.put(&quot;mid&quot;, vo.getMid());\r\nmap.put(&quot;name&quot;, vo.getName());\r\nmap.put(&quot;point&quot;, vo.getPoint() + &quot;&quot;);          // 숫자는 String 으로 변환\r\nmap.put(&quot;todayCount&quot;, vo.getTodayCount() + &quot;&quot;);\r\n\r\nJSONObject jObj = new JSONObject(map);\r\nString str = jObj.toJSONString();               // {&quot;mid&quot;:&quot;...&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;...&quot;}\r\nresponse.setContentType(&quot;application/json; charset=UTF-8&quot;);\r\nresponse.getWriter().write(str);</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">VO 여러 개 → JSON 배열</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">JSONArray jArray = new JSONArray();\r\nfor (MemberVO vo : vos) {\r\n    HashMap&lt;String, String&gt; map = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();\r\n    map.put(&quot;mid&quot;, vo.getMid());\r\n    map.put(&quot;name&quot;, vo.getName());\r\n    jArray.add(new JSONObject(map));\r\n}\r\nresponse.getWriter().write(jArray.toJSONString());   // [{...},{...}]</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">라이브러리: json-simple (구글 code archive / Maven com.googlecode.json-simple)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Map → JSON 객체 → 문자열로 바꿔 응답에 쓰면 ajax 의 success(res) 에서 문자열로 받는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Spring 에서는 @ResponseBody + Jackson 이 객체를 자동으로 JSON 변환</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> jQuery · ajax › JSON 응답 받기 (JSON.parse)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet/json-response","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"servlet","title":"서블릿 (웹)","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet"}],"hasImage":false}